{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人黃智雯（Mandy）向來懂得享受生活，日前她暫時逃離市區的急速節奏，到南丫島半日遊充電，並於社交網分享影片，她頭戴印花頭巾，身穿白色無袖長背心襯藍色牛仔褲，造型充滿度假風情。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Mandy甫落船便</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T13:17:44.050878+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:01:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T13:10:58.343015+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T13:10:58.343015+00:00","content_hash":"9dfde5b1f2f3e375c65de081f22c01d64060476233e0ce7ee08435cf15ef9faa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}